REMARK   exactly geomol's table, so leave the radius scale at 1.00.
REMARK
REMARK   Note: a hollow shell of identical atoms is the WORST case for
REMARK   the red cavity spheres -- most of its Delaunay tetrahedra are
REMARK   slivers whose circumcentre falls far outside them, so the
REMARK   cavity sphere misses the cell that should cut it.  Only 5 of
REMARK   24 cavity cells show anything at s = 0.5.  Use propofol or
REMARK   aspirin to judge the cavity patches.
